# Authored in OSRS journal style from the OSRS Wiki walkthrough (no Wiki journal transcript); stages pinned to the server's quest states.
before	<col=000080>I can start this quest by talking to <col=800000>King Narnode Shareen</col> in the <col=800000>Grand Tree</col>.</col>
before	
before	<col=000080>Difficulty:</col>
before	<col=800000>Intermediate</col>
before	<col=000080>Length:</col>
before	<col=800000>Medium</col>
before	<col=000080>Storyline:</col>
before	<col=800000>Gnome #1</col>
before	<col=000080>Release Year:</col>
before	<col=800000>2002</col>
before	
before	<col=000080>Requirements:</col>
req	Level 25 Agility
before	<col=800000>The ability to defeat a level 172 Black demon</col>
step	1	10	After starting the quest
line	<col=000080><col=800000>King Narnode Shareen</col> told me the <col=800000>Grand Tree</col> is dying. He gave me a <col=800000>Bark sample</col> and a <col=800000>Translation book</col>. I should take the sample to <col=800000>Hazelmere</col>, who lives on an island east of <col=800000>Yanille</col>.</col>
step	2	20	After speaking to Hazelmere
line	<str>King Narnode Shareen told me the Grand Tree is dying. He gave me a Bark sample and a Translation book.</str>
line	<col=000080><col=800000>Hazelmere</col> examined the bark and wrote me a scroll in the old gnome tongue. I should translate it and tell the King.</col>
step	3	30	After the translation
line	<str>King Narnode Shareen told me the Grand Tree is dying. He gave me a Bark sample and a Translation book.</str>
line	<str>Hazelmere examined the bark and wrote me a scroll in the old gnome tongue.</str>
line	<col=000080>The scroll said a man came to <col=800000>Hazelmere</col> with the King's seal and was given <col=800000>Daconia rocks</col>, which will kill the tree. <col=800000>King Narnode</col> sent me to <col=800000>Glough</col>. I should speak to <col=800000>Glough</col>.</col>
step	4	40	After speaking to Glough
line	<str>King Narnode Shareen told me the Grand Tree is dying. He gave me a Bark sample and a Translation book.</str>
line	<str>Hazelmere examined the bark and wrote me a scroll in the old gnome tongue.</str>
line	<str>The scroll said a man came to Hazelmere with the King's seal and was given Daconia rocks, which will kill the tree. King Narnode sent me to Glough.</str>
line	<col=000080><col=800000>Glough</col> insisted the humans are planning to invade. There is a prisoner in a cell at the top of the Grand Tree; perhaps he knows more.</col>
step	5	50	After speaking to Charlie
line	<str>King Narnode Shareen told me the Grand Tree is dying. He gave me a Bark sample and a Translation book.</str>
line	<str>Hazelmere examined the bark and wrote me a scroll in the old gnome tongue.</str>
line	<str>The scroll said a man came to Hazelmere with the King's seal and was given Daconia rocks, which will kill the tree. King Narnode sent me to Glough.</str>
line	<str>Glough insisted the humans are planning to invade.</str>
line	<col=000080><col=800000>Charlie</col> the prisoner told me it was <col=800000>Glough</col> who was behind it all. I should tell the King.</col>
step	6	60	After telling the King
line	<str>King Narnode Shareen told me the Grand Tree is dying. He gave me a Bark sample and a Translation book.</str>
line	<str>Hazelmere examined the bark and wrote me a scroll in the old gnome tongue.</str>
line	<str>The scroll said a man came to Hazelmere with the King's seal and was given Daconia rocks, which will kill the tree. King Narnode sent me to Glough.</str>
line	<str>Glough insisted the humans are planning to invade.</str>
line	<str>Charlie the prisoner told me it was Glough who was behind it all.</str>
line	<col=000080><col=800000>King Narnode</col> refused to believe me. I need proof. <col=800000>Glough</col> might keep something in his house.</col>
step	7	70	After finding the journal
line	<str>King Narnode Shareen told me the Grand Tree is dying. He gave me a Bark sample and a Translation book.</str>
line	<str>Hazelmere examined the bark and wrote me a scroll in the old gnome tongue.</str>
line	<str>The scroll said a man came to Hazelmere with the King's seal and was given Daconia rocks, which will kill the tree. King Narnode sent me to Glough.</str>
line	<str>Glough insisted the humans are planning to invade.</str>
line	<str>Charlie the prisoner told me it was Glough who was behind it all.</str>
line	<str>King Narnode refused to believe me.</str>
line	<col=000080>I found <col=800000>Glough</col>'s journal in his cupboard. I should confront <col=800000>Glough</col> with it.</col>
step	8	80	After being arrested
line	<str>King Narnode Shareen told me the Grand Tree is dying. He gave me a Bark sample and a Translation book.</str>
line	<str>Hazelmere examined the bark and wrote me a scroll in the old gnome tongue.</str>
line	<str>The scroll said a man came to Hazelmere with the King's seal and was given Daconia rocks, which will kill the tree. King Narnode sent me to Glough.</str>
line	<str>Glough insisted the humans are planning to invade.</str>
line	<str>Charlie the prisoner told me it was Glough who was behind it all.</str>
line	<str>King Narnode refused to believe me.</str>
line	<str>I found Glough's journal in his cupboard.</str>
line	<col=000080><col=800000>Glough</col> had me arrested. In the cell <col=800000>Charlie</col> gave me the password for the <col=800000>Karamja</col> shipyard: Ka-Lu-Min. I should wait for the King.</col>
step	9	90	After being freed
line	<str>King Narnode Shareen told me the Grand Tree is dying. He gave me a Bark sample and a Translation book.</str>
line	<str>Hazelmere examined the bark and wrote me a scroll in the old gnome tongue.</str>
line	<str>The scroll said a man came to Hazelmere with the King's seal and was given Daconia rocks, which will kill the tree. King Narnode sent me to Glough.</str>
line	<str>Glough insisted the humans are planning to invade.</str>
line	<str>Charlie the prisoner told me it was Glough who was behind it all.</str>
line	<str>King Narnode refused to believe me.</str>
line	<str>I found Glough's journal in his cupboard.</str>
line	<str>Glough had me arrested. In the cell Charlie gave me the password for the Karamja shipyard: Ka-Lu-Min.</str>
line	<col=000080><col=800000>King Narnode</col> let me out of the cell. I should look into the shipyard on <col=800000>Karamja</col>; <col=800000>Captain Errdo</col> can fly me there.</col>
