line	<col=000080>I showed <col=800000>King Narnode</col> the lumber order, but he still doubts me. <col=800000>Charlie</col> thinks <col=800000>Anita</col> might have a key to <col=800000>Glough</col>'s chest; if I bring the King the invasion plans, he should give me what I need to get into <col=800000>Glough</col>'s watchtower.</col>
